{"unit_id":"iTrimut__GitHub-Road#card-zh","repo":"iTrimut/GitHub-Road","commit":"37f5c37739e6c054c278955f12bf5b6a0b3922c2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"GitHub-Road 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的技能插件，用于把 GitHub 访问修复技能安装到 DSH 的技能目录。插件启动时读取 DSH_HOME（未设置时使用用户目录下的 .dsh），并在目标技能尚不存在时复制随包提供的技能文件，保留用户已有内容。技能文档提供 Windows 上检查 GitHub 官网连接、手动修复和计划任务配置的指引；这些操作脚本不包含在此提交的文件中。适合需要在 DSH 中加载相关操作说明的用户。插件本身不读取 API 密钥，也不声明额外外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:22-31","skills/GitHub-Road/SKILL.md:51-69"]}
{"unit_id":"iTrimut__GitHub-Road#card-en","repo":"iTrimut/GitHub-Road","commit":"37f5c37739e6c054c278955f12bf5b6a0b3922c2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"GitHub-Road is a DSH web skill plugin. At startup it copies its skill into DSH_HOME/skills, defaulting to ~/.dsh, and preserves an existing copy. Its document describes Windows GitHub access repair, but referenced scripts are absent from this commit. No API key or external service is declared.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:22-31","skills/GitHub-Road/SKILL.md:51-69"]}
